      'Book direct with camps on WhatsApp for best prices. Top camps: Rum Stars, Wadi Rum Night Luxury, Memories Aicha, Mohammed Mutlak Camp',
    ],
  },
  {
    icon: '🚗',
    title: 'Getting There',
    items: [
